{"id":"19a3080f0dd154a2","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-subformula.md","title":"Subformula","display":"df-subformula — Subformula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-subformula","aliases":["93-df-subformula"],"display":"df-subformula — Subformula","depends_on":["[[93-df-formula]]","[[93-df-term]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-subformula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-subformula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-subformula — Subformula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c2ca1af9af149e69\" href=\"?note=c2ca1af9af149e69\" title=\"93-df-formula\">93-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca7404158049be33\" href=\"?note=ca7404158049be33\" title=\"93-df-term\">93-df-term</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is a connective-type candidate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau)=T_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{At}_{93})\">\\(\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau)=T_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{At}_{93})\\)</span>, with tagged compound codes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t)\">\\(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t)\\)</span> as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca7404158049be33\" href=\"?note=ca7404158049be33\" title=\"93-df-term\">93-df-term</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{93}(-;\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{93}(-;\\tau)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subform}_{93}(-,-;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Subform}_{93}(-,-;\\tau)\\)</span> are defined here by recursion on formula depth.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subformula}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{93}(x;\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{x\\}\\qquad(x\\in\\mathrm{At}_{93})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subformula}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{93}(x;\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{x\\}\\qquad(x\\in\\mathrm{At}_{93})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subformula}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{93}(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t);\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t)\\}\\cup\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}\\operatorname{Sub}_{93}(\\bar t(i);\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subformula}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{93}(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t);\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t)\\}\\cup\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}\\operatorname{Sub}_{93}(\\bar t(i);\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subformula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Subform}_{93}(\\psi,\\varphi;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\psi,\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau)\n\\land\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{93}(\\varphi;\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subformula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Subform}_{93}(\\psi,\\varphi;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\psi,\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau)\n\\land\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{93}(\\varphi;\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The recursive set includes the formula itself and every descendant in its term tree. Carrying <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> prevents one formula tree from being traversed with another signature's arity map.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"c2ca1af9af149e69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"ca7404158049be33","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"ca7404158049be33","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau$ is a connective-type candidate and $\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau)=T_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{At}_{93})$, with tagged compound codes $\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t)$ as in [[93-df-term]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau)=T_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{At}_{93})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{93}(-;\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subform}_{93}(-,-;\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subformula}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{93}(x;\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{x\\}\\qquad(x\\in\\mathrm{At}_{93})","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subformula}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{93}(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t);\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t)\\}\\cup\n\\bigcup_{i<\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}\\operatorname{Sub}_{93}(\\bar t(i);\\tau)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subformula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Subform}_{93}(\\psi,\\varphi;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\psi,\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau)\n\\land\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{93}(\\varphi;\\tau)","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false}],"bytes":1326,"backlinks":[{"id":"a5ef915ed4ef0f09","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\psi,\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau)$ and $\\mathrm{Subform}_{93}(-,-;\\tau)$ is the relation of [[93-df-subformula]]."}],"outgoing":["c2ca1af9af149e69","ca7404158049be33"]}